{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1551122-gargoyle-charactes","id":1551122,"title":"Gargoyle Charactes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-05-18T08:28:25-07:00","id":1551122,"title":"Gargoyle Charactes","content":"I was wondering if any of you could offer me any feedback or advice on the best Seeming/Kith combinations for a Gargoyle Character? I have had great difficulties with designing my own kiths so I feel I have to use those already listed in the sourcebooks. For now I have decided on the Ogre Seeming due to the fact that Ogres bear the Nickname of Gargoyles and their favored regalia of Shield seems to lend itself to the Protector aspect of Gargoyles. As for Kith I have decided to go for Draconic as that is the only Kith that explicitly states in the Kith blessing that a character can grow wings for an additional expenditure of Glamour as well as from the fact that by reading into the folklore of Gargoyles I found that it was initially a dragon like creature known as the Gargouille from French Folklore. Please let me know if there are any flaws in my logic behind my decision or if any of you might have any ideas on how I could perhaps reskin the Draconic Kith to that of the Lurkglider Kith from the first edition source book Winter Masques.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-18T15:00:54-07:00","id":1551132,"title":"","content":"Clearly either a Beast or an Elemental. Perhaps a Beast with the stoneskin kith.<br /> <br /> My terminology might be off. I lost my copies of <b>Changeling: The Lost </b>in 2018. But a Gargoyle seems like a winged troll like creature made of stone.<br /> <br /> Somekind of Pact or Merit allowing flight would be needed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 05-18-2025, 06:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}